  unitName: Lava Phoenix
  unitId: 10113
  unitNumber: 136
  description: "A holy bird born from a volcano once every few millennia.It is a
    phoenix that has matured over the span of many years but still attacks by turning
    into a fireball. It allies with and defends those with ambition and a love of
    justice. History books speak of a Lava Phoenix appearing at the start of revolutions
    or coup d'\xE9tats and aiding those who fight for justice."
  summonDesc: You, Summoner who fights <br>with virtue and ambition...<br>Accept
    my protection.
  fusionDesc: This newfound power...<br>I will use it to <br>protect you.
  evoDesc: Summoner, you have a <br>good, stout heart.<br>I promise to defend you.
  element: 1
  rarity: 3
